  "releaseNotes": "- Added intuitive Worksheet Properties helper methods as worksheet extensions\n      - New methods include SetZoom(), SetDefaultColumnWidth(), SetDefaultRowHeight()\n      - Added display options control: ShowFormulas(), ShowGridlines(), ShowRowColumnHeaders()\n      - Implemented ShowZeroValues() for controlling the visibility of zero values in cells\n      - Added SetRightToLeft() to support right-to-left text direction for international users\n      - All methods support fluent method chaining for improved code readability",
